{"title":"How to use Table Charts for Dashboard Widgets","category":"Dashboards","categorySlug":"dashboards","folder":"Dashboard Widgets","html":"<h3><span><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; fullscreen\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/popsuD6hfgs?&amp;wmode=opaque\" title=\"Video\"></iframe></span><span><br/><strong>More Tutorials from the Community</strong></span></h3><p><span><br/><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xBGH_lohcSM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xBGH_lohcSM</a></span></p><p class=\"toc\"><span><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/DwcbZNaqup4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/DwcbZNaqup4</a></span></p><p class=\"toc\"><span><br/></span></p><p class=\"toc\"><span><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong><br/></span></p><ul><ul><ul><li><span><a href=\"#Step-1%3A-Add-a-widget\">Step 1: Add a widget</a></span></li><li><span><a href=\"#Step-2%3A-Choose-Table-chart\">Step 2: Choose Table chart</a></span></li><li><span><a href=\"#Step-3%3A-Configure-your-widget\">Step 3: Configure your widget</a></span></li><li><span><a href=\"#Step-3%3A-Save-your-changes\">Step 3: Save your changes</a></span></li></ul></ul></ul><hr/><h3 id=\"Step-1:-Add-a-widget\"><span><strong>Step 1: Add a Widget<br/></strong><br/></span></h3><ul><li><div><span>Go to your dashboard and Click on the edit icon and then Add widget<br/><br/></span></div></li></ul><h3 id=\"Step-2:-Choose-Table-chart\"><span><strong>Step 2: Choose Table Chart</strong><br/><br/></span></h3><ul><li><div><span>Scroll down to the widget you want to add and change the chart type to table</span><p><span><br/></span></p><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155022885087/original/Tv-DNpkI8qeG5vXbj_anl0A3YGPmNnTQKg.png?1710421262\"/><br/><br/></span></div></li></ul><h3 id=\"Step-3:-Configure-your-widget\"><span><strong>Step 3: Configure Your Widget<br/></strong><br/></span></h3><ul><li><div><span>Click on Select Columns to manage columns you want on your widget</span><p><span><br/></span></p><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155022885097/original/EyMRUGmsd3nGgTZ5OvmnuAA5nQVsch5a9w.png?1710421277\"/><br/><br/></span></div></li><li><div><span>In Advance Settings, you can choose the column on which you want to order the table</span><p><span><br/></span></p><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155022885142/original/8rZzu6fO66Tq1o4iEUxrllJh7L3--ovZlQ.png?1710421311\"/></span></div></li></ul><div><span><br/></span></div><pre><span><strong>Note (Email Widgets): Source Action Name</strong><br/>\nIn Email Widget table charts, <strong>Source Action Name</strong> helps you identify what triggered the email.<br/>If the email is associated with a <strong>workflow</strong>, <strong>Source Action Name</strong> displays the <strong>workflow step name</strong> to improve traceability in dashboards and reports.<br/></span></pre><h3 id=\"Step-3:-Save-your-changes\"><span><br/><strong>Step 4: Save Your Changes</strong><br/><br/></span></h3><ul><li><div><span>Click on Save to add your widget on the Dashboard</span><p><span><br/></span></p><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155022886687/original/cRu3tWKj6h2y424JHndURAxemS2w7hd57Q.png?1710422439\"/></span></div></li></ul>","updated":"Mon, 9 Mar, 2026 at 5:25 AM"}